Package: bayespk
Title: Bayesian Population Pharmacokinetics Without Writing 'Stan'
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Daiki", "Kumakura", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "55353329+DaikiKumakura@users.noreply.github.com")
Description: Fits 1- and 2-compartment linear population pharmacokinetic
    models by Bayesian inference. Models are described in a few lines of R and
    the data are a 'NONMEM'-style data set used as is. Precompiled 'Stan'
    programs use closed-form solutions superposed over doses, so no
    'CmdStan', no model code and no compilation are needed at run time.
    Reports convergence diagnostics by default and predicts new regimens from
    the posterior without refitting.
URL: https://github.com/DaikiKumakura/bayespk, https://daikikumakura.github.io/bayespk/
BugReports: https://github.com/DaikiKumakura/bayespk/issues
